        "version": "2.1.6.0",
        "changelog": "VGMdb Concerts 2.1.6\n\n- Plugin version: 2.1.6.0\n- Target Jellyfin ABI: 12.1.0.0\n- Upstream commit: c5c0218a4cd7c8eee5c4a9d2d6a7701eded92397\n- Independent plugin GUID: 553a22b2-1600-47c1-99e7-367c69ce0c09\n\nThis standalone build registers Movie-related VGMdb providers plus metadata and image providers restricted to generated concert collections. It does not register Artist/MusicAlbum providers and can coexist with Jellyfin's official VGMdb music plugin.\n",
